VMConstants comment: 'I answer the VM''s object-model constants: header bits, object formats, the special objects array, marker primitives, primitive error codes (primErr…, the error: code of a failed primitive), the context slack. My class-side methods are generated by boot/bootstrap.py from the EXPORTED CONSTANTS block of vm/src/vm.h, the single definition; each selector is the C name in lower camel case (SO_EXTERNAL_OBJECTS → soExternalObjects). Special-object indices (so…) are 1-based, ready for at:; everything else has the C value.'!
